{"title":"Career Roadmap · Science Writer","role":"Science Writer","summary":"A Science Writer translates scientific and technical information into accurate, understandable content for researchers, students, healthcare professionals, media organizations, publishers, universities, research institutions, technology companies, and the general public.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc. (Bachelor of Science – General / Honours)","Course":"Biophysics / Biomedical Science"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Typical route:"},{"type":"p","text":"B.Sc. Biophysics / Biomedical Science → Writing Portfolio + Internship → Science Writer / Scientific Content Writer → Senior Science Writer → Scientific Editor / Science Communication Lead → Editorial Director / Science Communication Consultant"}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons: 2026–2046","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Stage","Primary Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2028"},{"text":"Student / Writing Intern"},{"text":"Science fundamentals + writing"}],[{"text":"2028–2030"},{"text":"Junior Science Writer"},{"text":"Articles, blogs, research summaries"}],[{"text":"2030–2033"},{"text":"Science Writer / Scientific Writer"},{"text":"Specialized scientific content"}],[{"text":"2033–2037"},{"text":"Senior Science Writer / Editor"},{"text":"Complex scientific communication"}],[{"text":"2037–2042"},{"text":"Science Communication Lead / Editor"},{"text":"Editorial strategy + team leadership"}],[{"text":"2042–2046"},{"text":"Director / Consultant / Specialist"},{"text":"Science communication strategy + domain expertise"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Key Skills","Proof"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Scientific foundation"},{"text":"Biology, physics, chemistry, scientific vocabulary"},{"text":"Science notes + short articles"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Research literacy"},{"text":"Literature review, evidence evaluation, statistics"},{"text":"Research summaries"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Professional writing"},{"text":"Journalism, interviewing, editing, storytelling"},{"text":"Writing portfolio"}],[{"text":"Year 4 (if applicable)"},{"text":"Industry specialization"},{"text":"Biomedical writing, digital media, data visualization"},{"text":"Internship + portfolio"}],[{"text":"Post-graduation"},{"text":"Domain expertise"},{"text":"Scientific/medical/technical specialization"},{"text":"Published work + professional experience"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Build Scientific Foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"The first priority is becoming scientifically strong enough to understand the material you will later communicate."},{"type":"h","text":"Core subjects"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cell biology"},{"text":"Molecular biology"},{"text":"Biochemistry"},{"text":"Physics"},{"text":"Biophysics"},{"text":"Genetics"},{"text":"Human physiology"},{"text":"Chemistry"},{"text":"Mathematics"},{"text":"Basic statistics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Start writing immediately"},{"type":"p","text":"Write short articles explaining topics such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"How DNA stores information"},{"text":"How MRI works"},{"text":"What proteins do"},{"text":"How vaccines stimulate immunity"},{"text":"How cancer develops"},{"text":"How neurons communicate"},{"text":"What artificial intelligence means for healthcare"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The goal is to learn how to explain complex science without making it scientifically inaccurate."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Learn Research Literacy"},{"type":"p","text":"A Science Writer must be able to distinguish:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Evidence","Interpretation","Claim","Speculation"]},{"type":"h","text":"Learn to read scientific papers"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Abstract"},{"text":"Introduction"},{"text":"Methods"},{"text":"Results"},{"text":"Discussion"},{"text":"Limitations"},{"text":"Figures"},{"text":"Tables"},{"text":"References"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Learn evidence evaluation"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Correlation vs causation"},{"text":"Sample size"},{"text":"Control groups"},{"text":"Statistical significance"},{"text":"Confidence intervals"},{"text":"Bias"},{"text":"Confounding variables"},{"text":"Replication"},{"text":"Systematic reviews"},{"text":"Meta-analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Writing exercise"},{"type":"p","text":"Take one scientific paper and produce:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"100-word summary"},{"text":"500-word public explanation"},{"text":"Technical summary"},{"text":"Key findings"},{"text":"Limitations"},{"text":"Questions for the researchers"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This is excellent portfolio material."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Become a Professional Science Writer"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop three different writing styles."},{"type":"h","text":"1. General-public writing"},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"p","text":"\"What happens inside the brain when we sleep?\""},{"type":"p","text":"Simple language, accurate science and strong storytelling."},{"type":"h","text":"2. Technical writing"},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"p","text":"\"Recent advances in molecular imaging for neurological disorders.\""},{"type":"p","text":"More technical terminology and citations."},{"type":"h","text":"3. Research communication"},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"p","text":"A 1,000-word explanation of a newly published research paper."},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"What researchers discovered"},{"text":"How they discovered it"},{"text":"Why it matters"},{"text":"What remains unknown"}]}]},{"heading":"Essential Science-Writing Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Scientific writing"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Scientific terminology"},{"text":"Citation practices"},{"text":"Literature review"},{"text":"Research summarization"},{"text":"Fact-checking"},{"text":"Evidence evaluation"},{"text":"Source verification"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Editorial skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Copyediting"},{"text":"Proofreading"},{"text":"Structural editing"},{"text":"Headline writing"},{"text":"Content planning"},{"text":"Style guides"},{"text":"Citation management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Journalism skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Interviewing scientists"},{"text":"Asking research questions"},{"text":"Finding primary sources"},{"text":"Investigative research"},{"text":"Source attribution"},{"text":"Avoiding sensationalism"}]}]},{"heading":"Digital Science Communication","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Modern Science Writers should not depend exclusively on text."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Infographic creation"},{"text":"Data visualization"},{"text":"Presentation design"},{"text":"Video scripting"},{"text":"Podcast scripting"},{"text":"Social-media science communication"},{"text":"Web publishing"},{"text":"Basic SEO"},{"text":"Newsletter writing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful tools include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Canva"},{"text":"Adobe Illustrator"},{"text":"Figma"},{"text":"WordPress/CMS platforms"},{"text":"Basic HTML/CSS"},{"text":"Python for scientific data visualization"}]}]},{"heading":"Science Specialisations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Specialisation","Topics","Possible Career"],"rows":[[{"text":"Biomedical Science"},{"text":"Diseases, diagnostics, therapies"},{"text":"Biomedical Writer"}],[{"text":"Biophysics"},{"text":"Imaging, molecular systems, physics of biology"},{"text":"Biophysics Writer"}],[{"text":"Genomics"},{"text":"DNA, sequencing, precision medicine"},{"text":"Genomics Writer"}],[{"text":"Neuroscience"},{"text":"Brain, cognition, neurological disease"},{"text":"Neuroscience Writer"}],[{"text":"Biotechnology"},{"text":"Biotech products and research"},{"text":"Biotechnology Writer"}],[{"text":"Pharmaceutical Science"},{"text":"Drugs, clinical research"},{"text":"Medical/Pharma Writer"}],[{"text":"Physics"},{"text":"Fundamental/applied physics"},{"text":"Physics Writer"}],[{"text":"Astronomy"},{"text":"Space and astrophysics"},{"text":"Astronomy Writer"}],[{"text":"Climate Science"},{"text":"Climate, environment, modelling"},{"text":"Climate Science Writer"}],[{"text":"Technology"},{"text":"AI, computing, emerging technology"},{"text":"Technology/Science Writer"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"For this degree, biomedical and biotechnology writing are especially natural specialisations."}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Look for internships with:"},{"type":"h","text":"Research institutions"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Universities"},{"text":"Research laboratories"},{"text":"Scientific organizations"},{"text":"Research communication teams"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Publishers"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Scientific publishers"},{"text":"Academic journals"},{"text":"Educational publishers"},{"text":"Science magazines"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pharmaceutical companies"},{"text":"Biotechnology companies"},{"text":"Hospitals"},{"text":"Diagnostic companies"},{"text":"Medical communication agencies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Media"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Science magazines"},{"text":"News organizations"},{"text":"Digital science publications"},{"text":"Educational media companies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Internship titles"},{"type":"p","text":"Search for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Science Writing Intern"},{"text":"Scientific Content Intern"},{"text":"Science Communication Intern"},{"text":"Research Communication Intern"},{"text":"Medical Writing Intern"},{"text":"Technical Writing Intern"},{"text":"Biomedical Content Intern"},{"text":"Editorial Intern"},{"text":"Scientific Editorial Intern"}]}]},{"heading":"Strong Portfolio Project","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"note","label":"Project","text":"Research-to-Public Article Series"},{"type":"p","text":"Select 10 recent scientific papers in biomedical science."},{"type":"p","text":"For each paper create:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Scientific paper summary"},{"text":"500–800 word public article"},{"text":"Research infographic"},{"text":"Key findings"},{"text":"Limitations"},{"text":"\"What this means\" section"},{"text":"References to primary sources"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Create a portfolio website containing all 10 articles."},{"type":"p","text":"This demonstrates:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Science knowledge","research literacy","writing","editing","visual communication."],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Build a 20–30 Piece Portfolio","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, aim for:"},{"type":"table","header":["Content","Target"],"rows":[[{"text":"Science articles"},{"text":"8–10"}],[{"text":"Research-paper explainers"},{"text":"5"}],[{"text":"Biomedical articles"},{"text":"5"}],[{"text":"Infographics"},{"text":"3–5"}],[{"text":"Interview/article"},{"text":"2–3"}],[{"text":"Data visualization"},{"text":"2–3"}],[{"text":"Video/podcast scripts"},{"text":"2–3"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"The portfolio is often more persuasive for writing roles than a certificate collection."}]},{"heading":"Certifications and Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Prioritize:"},{"type":"h","text":"Scientific communication"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Scientific writing"},{"text":"Science communication"},{"text":"Research methodology"},{"text":"Academic writing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Writing"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Copyediting"},{"text":"Technical writing"},{"text":"Journalism"},{"text":"Content strategy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Data visualization"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Domain"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Molecular biology"},{"text":"Genetics"},{"text":"Biotechnology"},{"text":"Biomedical research"},{"text":"Clinical research"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Certificates should supplement the portfolio rather than replace it."}]},{"heading":"Careers You Can Be Hired As","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Potential entry-level roles include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Writing"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Science Writer"},{"text":"Scientific Content Writer"},{"text":"Science Content Executive"},{"text":"Scientific Writer"},{"text":"Technical Writer"},{"text":"Research Content Writer"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Publishing"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Editorial Assistant"},{"text":"Scientific Editorial Assistant"},{"text":"Journal Editorial Assistant"},{"text":"Content Editor"},{"text":"Publishing Assistant"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Biomedical"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Biomedical Writer"},{"text":"Medical Content Writer"},{"text":"Healthcare Content Writer"},{"text":"Medical Communications Associate"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research communication"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research Communication Assistant"},{"text":"Science Communication Assistant"},{"text":"Outreach Associate"},{"text":"Scientific Communications Executive"}]}]},{"heading":"Employer Interview Questions","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Scientific"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Explain a complex scientific topic in simple language."},{"text":"How do you determine whether a scientific claim is reliable?"},{"text":"What is the difference between correlation and causation?"},{"text":"How do you read a research paper?"},{"text":"What is peer review?"},{"text":"How do you identify limitations in a study?"},{"text":"How would you explain a statistical result to a general audience?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Writing"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"How would you turn a research paper into a 600-word article?"},{"text":"How do you verify scientific facts?"},{"text":"How do you avoid plagiarism?"},{"text":"How do you handle conflicting scientific sources?"},{"text":"How would you interview a scientist?"},{"text":"How do you write for a non-technical audience?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Practical test"},{"type":"p","text":"An employer may give you:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Research paper","500-word article","headline","summary","social-media post"]},{"type":"p","text":"You should be able to complete the entire workflow."}]},{"heading":"Biomedical / Medical Writing Route","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Because the degree is Biophysics / Biomedical Science, biomedical writing is a particularly strong specialization."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Clinical research basics"},{"text":"Clinical trials"},{"text":"Drug development"},{"text":"Diagnostics"},{"text":"Pharmacology fundamentals"},{"text":"Medical terminology"},{"text":"Regulatory documentation"},{"text":"Evidence-based medicine"},{"text":"Clinical research methodology"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Possible roles:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Biomedical Writer","Medical Writer","Senior Medical Writer","Medical Communications Lead"]},{"type":"p","text":"Medical writing can include scientific and healthcare communication, but specialized regulatory/clinical-document roles may have additional employer-specific requirements."}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Science-focused PG"},{"type":"p","text":"Consider:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"M.Sc. Biophysics"},{"text":"M.Sc. Biomedical Science"},{"text":"M.Sc. Biotechnology"},{"text":"M.Sc. Biochemistry"},{"text":"M.Sc. Molecular Biology"},{"text":"M.Sc. Genetics"},{"text":"M.Sc. Bioinformatics"},{"text":"M.Sc. Life Sciences"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This route is useful if you want stronger scientific authority before entering specialized writing."},{"type":"h","text":"Communication-focused PG"},{"type":"p","text":"Consider:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"M.A. Science Communication"},{"text":"M.A. Journalism"},{"text":"M.A. Mass Communication"},{"text":"M.A. Communication"},{"text":"M.A. Technical Communication"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A strong combination is:"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Sc. Biomedical Science → M.Sc. Biomedical/related science → Science/Medical Writing"},{"type":"p","text":"or"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Sc. Biomedical Science → M.A. Science Communication/Journalism → Science Writer"}]},{"heading":"Research Communication Route","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For research-intensive communication:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc.","M.Sc.","Research Experience","Science Writer/Research Communicator"]},{"type":"p","text":"Possible employers:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Universities"},{"text":"Research institutes"},{"text":"Scientific societies"},{"text":"Publishers"},{"text":"Research foundations"},{"text":"Science museums"},{"text":"Science outreach organizations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Having actual research experience can make it easier to understand and communicate complex scientific work accurately."}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Potential postgraduate fields:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Science Communication"},{"text":"Biomedical Science"},{"text":"Biophysics"},{"text":"Biotechnology"},{"text":"Medical Communications"},{"text":"Journalism"},{"text":"Technical Communication"},{"text":"Bioinformatics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Countries to research:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UK"},{"text":"USA"},{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"Germany"},{"text":"Netherlands"},{"text":"Ireland"},{"text":"Singapore"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For Science Communication programs, evaluate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research opportunities"},{"text":"Industry internships"},{"text":"Publishing opportunities"},{"text":"University science-communication teams"},{"text":"Media partnerships"},{"text":"Alumni employment"}]}]},{"heading":"Science Writer + AI","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"AI will significantly change scientific content production."},{"type":"p","text":"A future Science Writer should know how to use AI for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Literature organization"},{"text":"First-draft generation"},{"text":"Research summarization"},{"text":"Headline ideas"},{"text":"Content restructuring"},{"text":"Translation"},{"text":"Data visualization assistance"},{"text":"Interview preparation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"But the critical skill is verification."},{"type":"p","text":"AI-generated scientific claims can be incorrect, fabricated or improperly cited."},{"type":"p","text":"Therefore:"},{"type":"flow","items":["AI-assisted writing","primary-source verification","scientific judgment"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"will be much more valuable than simply knowing how to generate text."}]},{"heading":"Data + Science Writing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Adding data skills creates another career advantage."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"matplotlib"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Basic SQL"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Possible projects:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Epidemiological data visualization"},{"text":"Clinical-trial data explanation"},{"text":"Public-health dashboard"},{"text":"Cancer statistics visualization"},{"text":"Genomics data storytelling"},{"text":"Healthcare trend analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This creates a hybrid profile:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Science","Data","Communication"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Writing route"},{"type":"h","text":"Science Writer"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Science Writer"},{"type":"h","text":"Scientific Editor"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Editor"},{"type":"h","text":"Editorial Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Editorial Director"},{"type":"h","text":"Communication route"},{"type":"h","text":"Science Communication Executive"},{"type":"h","text":"Science Communication Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"Communication Lead"},{"type":"h","text":"Head of Science Communication"},{"type":"h","text":"Biomedical route"},{"type":"h","text":"Biomedical Writer"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Biomedical Writer"},{"type":"h","text":"Scientific/Medical Communications Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Communications Director"}]},{"heading":"Freelance / Entrepreneurship Route","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Experienced Science Writers can also build independent careers."},{"type":"p","text":"Potential services:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Scientific articles"},{"text":"Research summaries"},{"text":"Medical content"},{"text":"Technical documentation"},{"text":"Research newsletters"},{"text":"Science blogs"},{"text":"Grant-support writing"},{"text":"Institutional communication"},{"text":"Scientific video scripts"},{"text":"Educational content"},{"text":"Science communication consulting"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Possible business model:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Science Writer","Specialist Writer","Personal Brand","Freelance Consultancy / Science Media Company"]}]},{"heading":"PhD + Science Communication Route","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For students who want to become highly specialized:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc.","M.Sc.","PhD","Research + Science Communication"]},{"type":"p","text":"A PhD is not mandatory to become a Science Writer."},{"type":"p","text":"However, it can be valuable for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Highly technical scientific writing"},{"text":"Research communication"},{"text":"Academic publishing"},{"text":"Specialist science journalism"},{"text":"Research-institution communication"},{"text":"Senior scientific editorial positions"}]}]},{"heading":"2040–2046 Evolution","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The Science Writer of the future may work across:"},{"type":"h","text":"AI-assisted science communication"},{"type":"p","text":"AI helps process enormous scientific literature collections."},{"type":"h","text":"Interactive science"},{"type":"p","text":"Articles may become interactive data experiences rather than static text."},{"type":"h","text":"Scientific visualization"},{"type":"p","text":"Complex biomedical research will increasingly require visual explanation."},{"type":"h","text":"Personalized science communication"},{"type":"p","text":"Different audiences may receive different levels of scientific complexity."},{"type":"h","text":"Research translation"},{"type":"p","text":"Writers will increasingly connect:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Research","Industry","Healthcare","Public"]},{"type":"h","text":"Misinformation management"},{"type":"p","text":"Scientific fact-checking and evidence verification will become increasingly important."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, aim for:"},{"type":"h","text":"Scientific"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Biology"},{"text":"Biochemistry"},{"text":"Biophysics"},{"text":"Molecular biology"},{"text":"Genetics"},{"text":"Biomedical science"},{"text":"Basic statistics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Scientific-paper reading"},{"text":"Literature review"},{"text":"Evidence evaluation"},{"text":"Research methodology"},{"text":"Data interpretation"},{"text":"Citation management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Writing"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Scientific writing"},{"text":"Science journalism"},{"text":"Copyediting"},{"text":"Proofreading"},{"text":"Storytelling"},{"text":"Interviewing"},{"text":"Fact-checking"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data visualization"},{"text":"Infographics"},{"text":"Video scripting"},{"text":"Web publishing"},{"text":"SEO basics"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Python basics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-assisted research"},{"text":"AI-assisted writing"},{"text":"Prompting"},{"text":"Source verification"},{"text":"AI fact-checking"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Industry proof"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"20–30 writing samples"},{"text":"1 professional portfolio website"},{"text":"1–2 internships"},{"text":"5+ research-paper explainers"},{"text":"3–5 biomedical articles"},{"text":"2–3 data visualizations"},{"text":"2–3 multimedia pieces"}]}]},{"heading":"Target Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Science foundation","Year 2: Research literacy + scientific writing","Year 3: Professional writing + journalism + portfolio","Year 4: Biomedical specialization + internship","Graduate: Science Writer / Scientific Content Writer","2–5 years: Senior Science Writer / Biomedical Writer","5–10 years: Scientific Editor / Communication Lead","10–20 years: Editorial Director / Science Communication Director / Consultant"],"label":"Year 1"},{"type":"h","text":"Best profile by graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"B.Sc. Biophysics/Biomedical Science + strong scientific foundation + research-paper literacy + scientific writing + biomedical specialization + journalism/interviewing + data visualization + AI-assisted research skills + 20–30 piece portfolio + internship experience."},{"type":"p","text":"899 | UG | Science | B.Sc (General / Honours) | Medical Biotechnology / Molecular Biology / Genomics | Research Associate"}]}]}